This addon is NOT versioned (its contents are ignored in .gitignore).

Install it manually before opening the project:
  - Godot AssetLib: "Godot Rollback Netcode" (author: David Snopek)
  - or https://gitlab.com/snopek-games/godot-rollback-netcode
    -> extract into addons/godot-rollback-netcode/ (must contain Plugin.gd, plugin.cfg)

project.godot enables this plugin and the SyncManager autoload; the project won't open cleanly without this addon.
